# text = I have so corrupted and changed the nature of all those who have ever attended on me , by breeding avaricious plots and hopes within them ; I have engendered such domestic strife and discord , by tarrying even with members of my own family ; I have been such a lighted torch in peaceful homes , kindling up all the inflammable gases and vapours in their moral atmosphere , which , but for me , might have proved harmless to the end , that I have , I may say , fled from all who knew me , and taking refuge in secret places have lived , of late , the life of one who is hunted .
