# text = If it had been for anything but a bill , I could have borne it , and could still have looked upon mankind with some feeling of respect ; but when such a man as my friend Slyme is detained for a score -- a thing in itself essentially mean ; a low performance on a slate , or possibly chalked upon the back of a door -- I do feel that there is a screw of such magnitude loose somewhere , that the whole framework of society is shaken , and the very first principles of things can no longer be trusted .
