# text = If you would but sometimes , in some quiet hour ; beside the winter fire ; in the summer air ; when you hear gentle music , or think of Death , or Home , or Childhood ; if you would at such a season resolve to think , but once a month , or even once a year , of him , or any one who ever wronged you , you would forgive him in your heart , I know If I believed that to be true , Mary I would resolve at no such time to bear him in my mind ; wishing to spare myself the shame of such a weakness .
