# text = But what I always says to them as has the management of matters , Mrs Harris be they gents or be they ladies , is , don't ask me whether I won't take none , or whether I will , but leave the bottle on the chimley-piece , and let me put my lips to it when I am so dispoged Well , Mrs Gamp , and how are YOU , Mrs Gamp Pretty well , I thank you , sir You'll be very particular here , Mrs Gamp .
