# text = And if , sir if , sir , in such a place , and at such a time , I might venture to con-clude with a sentiment , glancing -- however slantin'dicularly -- at the subject in hand , I would say , sir , may the British Lion have his talons eradicated by the noble bill of the American Eagle , and be taught to play upon the Irish Harp and the Scotch Fiddle that music which is breathed in every empty shell that lies upon the shores of green Co-lumbia General Choke you warm my heart ; sir , you warm my heart .
