# text = The law being hard upon us , we're not exactly soft upon B ; for besides charging B the regular interest , we get B's premium , and B's friends' premiums , and we charge B for the bond , and , whether we accept him or not , we charge B for " inquiries " ( we keep a man , at a pound a week , to make 'em ), and we charge B a trifle for the secretary ; and in short , my good fellow , we stick it into B , up hill and down dale , and make a devilish comfortable little property out of him .
