# text = What are my feelings as a father , when , after my desire ( repeatedly expressed to Miss Pinch , as I think she will not venture to deny ) that my daughter should be choice in her expressions , genteel in her deportment , as becomes her station in life , and politely distant to her inferiors in society , I find her , only this very morning , addressing Miss Pinch herself as a beggar A beggarly thing Which is worse which is worse .
