# text = There is naturally something so handy and brisk about you , Ruth , that if you said you could make a bowl of faultless turtle soup , I should believe you for meat must be humoured , not drove What are you writing , Tom Why , you see , my dear I am very anxious , of course , to obtain some suitable employment ; and before Mr Westlock comes this afternoon , I think I may as well prepare a little description of myself and my qualifications ; such as he could show to any friend of his You had better do the same for me , Tom , also I should dearly like to keep house for you and take care of you always , Tom ; but we are not rich enough for that We are not rich certainly ; and we may be much poorer .
